⚙️ <b>Alert thresholds</b>
Tune with ➖ / ➕ (steps of 5):
<pre> CPU       90%
 Memory    90%
 Disk      85%
 Temp      85°C
 Battery   15%
</pre>
Alerts fire when a value crosses its threshold
(battery: when below).

📰 Daily digest <b>on</b> at 09:00 — tap the middle
button to toggle, ➖/➕ to shift the hour.
--- keyboard ---
[➖] → th:cpu:-5  [🖥 CPU 90%] → noop  [➕] → th:cpu:+5
[➖] → th:mem:-5  [🧠 Memory 90%] → noop  [➕] → th:mem:+5
[➖] → th:disk:-5  [💾 Disk 85%] → noop  [➕] → th:disk:+5
[➖] → th:temp:-5  [🌡 Temp 85°C] → noop  [➕] → th:temp:+5
[➖] → th:batt:-5  [🔋 Battery 15%] → noop  [➕] → th:batt:+5
[➖] → dg:hour:-1  [📰 on · 09:00] → dg:toggle  [➕] → dg:hour:+1
[⬅️ Status] → status  [👁 Watching] → watching
